      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The park’s Boat House, designed by Schmidt, Garden and Martin, and the Field House, renovated in 2013, are two of its three major historic buildings.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
