      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Humboldt Park’s community once hosted a diverse mix of Germans, Scandinavians, Poles, Italians, and Jews before becoming a hub for Puerto Rican culture.",
